# Web3Forms public access key (client-side). Copy to .env.local — do not commit secrets.
# Free plan requires browser submit; restrict the key to your domain in the Web3Forms dashboard.
# https://web3forms.com/ · docs: https://docs.web3forms.com/
# Required in production only. Local `next dev` / localhost never calls Web3Forms
# and does not validate this key (must be a UUID when set for production).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
